Copyright holder and authorship record for **YT Convert**
(https://github.com/rahmanjimmy504-code/yt-convert).

This file exists to resolve the contributor-rights blocker recorded in
`docs/licensing-audit.md` §1. See `CONTRIBUTING.md` for the Developer
Certificate of Origin (DCO) that governs all future contributions.

